{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119152736515-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119152736\"/><p>中國商務部指中美兩國經貿團隊在各層級保持溝通。</p><p>中國商務部發言人何亞東周四（19日）表示，中美兩國經貿團隊在各層級保持溝通，中美雙方上周五（13日）通過視頻會議方式舉行了中美經貿磋商機制項下貿易理事會首次會議。貿易理事會下設的農業工作組也將於近期召開首次會議。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:43:52.433402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:27:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.673266+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:37:16.895269+00:00","content_hash":"fd4ff19e924ebb6c4240790167478791ab802f907464a19b8386e59ad5a2cd54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}